  "details": "I'll need to test more and put more specifics but there are a lot of errors relating to copy-pasting Udon behavior nodes after the drop-down implementation. \nIf you select a large section of nodes to copy-paste, and there is a new Udon Behavior node in the middle, it won't paste anything after that node. \nIf you try to copy-paste just an udon behavior variable, a set program node, with some inputs to a new graph it won't copy-paste and in many cases just messes up all of your graphs until you close and open the graph window completely. Sometimes it has also completely unassigned the Udon Behavior from the Game Object in the hierarchy.",
